          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IB what-if estimate in USD, not cash collateral. Positive adds required margin; negative reduces it. Changes with account positions and market conditions; no order is submitted.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "IB What-if 美元预估，并非现金担保金额。正数表示增加所需保证金，负数表示减少；会随账户持仓和行情变化，不会提交订单。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "Reported shares differ from current holdings. This cost snapshot does not describe the current position.": {
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "报表股数与当前持仓不同，这份成本快照不能代表当前持仓成本。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
